<!--
  kw-vip scene_v4 (models/make_scene_v4.py): mobile base + apartment corridor + door lock keypad.
  Educational low-poly assembly: simplified FIXED powered-wheelchair +
  AgileX PiPER joint chain, actuator ranges and joint transforms transcribed
  from the MIT-licensed MuJoCo Menagerie AgileX PiPER model (RosenYin, 2024).
